</span></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.1\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.1s, transform 0s ease-out 0.1s\"><h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl\">Building businesses.<br/><span class=\"text-accent\">Enabling innovation.</span><br/>Shaping the future.</h1></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.2\" style=\"transition-delay:0.2s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.2s, transform 0s ease-out 0.2s\"><p class=\"max-w-xl text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-muted\">Jallal Group is a growing business group focused on technology, innovation, real estate, education and digital ventures. We build businesses and solutions designed to create lasting value across Sierra Leone and beyond.</p></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.3\" style=\"transition-delay:0.3s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.3s, transform 0s ease-out 0.3s\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-3 pt-1 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-ink text-white hover:bg-forest shadow-sm hover:shadow-raised h-12 px-7 btn-press\" href=\"/our-companies/jallal-tech\">Explore our companies<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none w