e-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-medium bg-success-soft text-success\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span>In development</span></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-headline-md font-bold text-ink\">Jallal Pay</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Payments, wallet and merchant rails for West African commerce</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-md bg-surface px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">Target launch market</span><span class=\"text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink\">Bo, Sierra Leone</span></div><div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent btn-press\" href=\"/digital-ventures#jallal-pay\">View venture<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"group hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-raised lg:p-7\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"label-caps text-accent\">Urban mobility technology</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-medium bg-sunken text-muted\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-strong\"></span>Prototyping</span></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bus h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 6v6\"></path><path d=\"M15 6v6\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h19.6\"></path><path d=\"M18 18h3s.5-1.7.8-2.8c.1-.4.2-.8.2-1.2 0-.4-.1-.8-.2-1.2l-1.4-5C20.1 6.8 19.1 6 18 6H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v10h3\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 18h5\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-headline-md font-bold text-ink\">Waka Salone</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Route intelligence for Bo, Sierra Leone&#x27;s commuter corridors</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-md bg-surface px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">Platform type</span><span class=\"text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink\">Mobility grid API</span></div><div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent btn-press\" href=\"/digital-ventures#waka-salone\">View venture<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class=\"group hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-raised lg:p-7\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"label-caps text-accent\">PropTech ecosystem</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 font-medium bg-sunken text-muted\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-line-strong\"></span>Architecture</span></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house lucide-home h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-headline-md font-bold text-ink\">First Home</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-body-md leading-relaxed text-muted\">Verified land and property discovery for emerging buyers</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-md bg-surface px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">Data architecture</span><span class=\"text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink\">Verified land registry</span></div><div class=\"mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent btn-press\" href=\"/digital-ventures#first-home\">View venture<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-forest py-16 text-white lg:py-24\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-lime/10 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"page-container relative\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-8\"><span class=\"label-caps inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-lime\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-8 bg-lime\"></span>Conglomerate mandate</span><h2 class=\"max-w-3xl text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-white lg:text-display-lg\">From local innovation to global opportunity.</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">Jallal Group is driven by the ambition to build sustainable businesses, develop meaningful technology and create opportunities that contribute to the growth of Sierra Leone and the wider African economy.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 pt-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Domestic grounding</span><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">Rooted directly in Sierra Leone&#x27;s physical and digital economy, with a working understanding of local market dynamics and citizen priorities.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">International scale</span><p class=\"text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">Applying world-class architecture and technical discipline so every subsidiary can scale sustainably across West Africa.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-6\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Group blueprint</span><div class=\"mt-5 space-y-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-body-sm\"><span class=\"text-on-dark-muted\">Strategic autonomy</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-lime\">Maintained</span></div><div class=\"h-1.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-lime w-full\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-body-sm\"><span class=\"text-on-dark-muted\">Inter-subsidiary synergy</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-lime\">Shared infrastructure</span></div><div class=\"h-1.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-lime w-3/4\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-body-sm\"><span class=\"text-on-dark-muted\">Long-term capital horizon</span><span class=\"font-semibold text-lime\">Generational</span></div><div class=\"h-1.5 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-lime w-5/6\"></div></div></div></div></div><figure class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5\"><blockquote class=\"text-body-sm italic leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">“We don&#x27;t just build companies to capture value; we engineer systems that create lasting sovereign resilience.”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"label-caps mt-3 text-lime\">Jallal Group leadership</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface py-16 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 lg:col-span-5\"><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0\" style=\"transition-delay:0s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0s, transform 0s ease-out 0s\"><span class=\"label-caps inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-6 bg-accent\"></span>Institutional alliances</span></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.1\" style=\"transition-delay:0.1s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.1s, transform 0s ease-out 0.1s\"><h2 class=\"text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-ink lg:text-display-lg\">Growth through strategic partnerships.</h2></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.2\" style=\"transition-delay:0.2s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.2s, transform 0s ease-out 0.2s\"><p class=\"text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-muted\">Jallal Group welcomes partnerships with organisations, institutions, investors and individuals who share our commitment to innovation, sustainable business growth and meaningful opportunity creation.</p></div><div data-scroll-reveal=\"0.3\" style=\"transition-delay:0.3s;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 0s ease-out 0.3s, transform 0s ease-out 0.3s\"><div class=\"pt-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-ink text-white hover:bg-forest shadow-sm hover:shadow-raised h-12 px-7 btn-press\" href=\"/partnerships\">Engage with our leadership<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-7 reveal-group\"><article class=\"hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-raised\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-handshake h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4\"></path><path d=\"m21 3 1 11h-2\"></path><path d=\"M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 4h8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Strategic Partnerships</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Cross-industry commercial alliances, regional distribution pacts and joint ventures designed to extend operational footprints across Sierra Leone and ECOWAS trade corridors.</p></article><article class=\"hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-raised\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Technology Partnerships</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Cloud infrastructure providers, enterprise software alliances, developer tooling and payment network interoperability for Jallal Pay and group platforms.</p></article><article class=\"hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-raised\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-landmark h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M11.119 2.205a2 2 0 0 1 1.762 0l7.84 3.846A.5.5 0 0 1 20.5 7h-17a.5.5 0 0 1-.22-.949z\"></path><path d=\"M14 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M18 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M6 18v-7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Institutional Partnerships</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Academic research collaborations, governmental capacity development, bilateral agency programmes and large-scale digital literacy deployments through the Jallal Institute of Technology.</p></article><article class=\"hover-lift rounded-lg border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card hover:border-accent/40 hover:shadow-raised\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-title-md font-semibold text-ink\">Business Development</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Co-marketing structures, enterprise supplier integrations and accelerated SME market-entry programmes powered by Elevate 360&#x27;s growth practice.</p></article></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-forest py-16 text-white lg:py-24\"><div class=\"page-container\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-6 py-12 text-center shadow-overlay md:px-12 lg:px-16 lg:py-16\"><span class=\"label-caps text-lime\">Initiate dialogue</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-display-md font-bold tracking-tight text-white lg:text-display-lg\">Let&#x27;s build something meaningful.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-dark-muted\">Connect with Jallal Group to explore business opportunities, strategic partnerships and ventures designed to shape the future of emerging African markets.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex w-full flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:w-auto sm:flex-row\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap bg-lime text-ink hover:bg-accent hover:text-white h-12 px-7\" href=\"/partnerships#inquiry\">Partner with us</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[11px] leading-4 transition-all duration-200 disabled:opacity-60 disabled:pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap shadow-sm hover:shadow-raised h-12 px-7 border border-white/20 bg-transparent text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-ink\" href=\"/our-companies\">Explore our companies</a></div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-body-sm text-on-dark-muted\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-4 w-4 text-lime\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Bo, Sierra Leone</span><a href=\"mailto:partnerships@jal